 Second article 
 Content… 


 Third article 
 Content… 


```

```css hidden live-sample___flexbox_1
body {
 font-family: sans-serif;
 margin: 0;
}
header {
 background: purple;
 height: 100px;
}
h1 {
 text-align: center;
 color: white;
 line-height: 100px;
 margin: 0;
}
section {
 zoom: 0.8;
}
article {
 padding: 10px;
