 Content… 


 Fourth article 
 Content… 


 Fifth article 
 Content… 


```

```css hidden live-sample___flex-wrap_0
body {
 font-family: sans-serif;
 margin: 0;
}
header {
 background: purple;
 height: 100px;
}
h1 {
 text-align: center;
 color: white;
 line-height: 100px;
 margin: 0;
}
article {
 min-width: 400px;
