 rgb(255 0 255) 
 pink, medium, bright 







 Previous 
 Showing page 1 of 20 
 Next 


```

```css live-sample___app-start
* {
 box-sizing: border-box;
}

html {
 font-family: "Helvetica", "Arial", sans-serif;
}

